# cards: the battle Item command opens the item list directly, with no Tools / Cards page, and Back returns to the
# command page (docs/plan-cards.md 2.4). Jian and Lucia (party2_strong). Item: the list (bi_list); B: the command
# page (bi_back); Item again (bi_list2); Fight still works from the command page after (bi_fight).
include party2_strong
wait 270
watch u16 0x020B880A page
press A 8
wait 50
press Down 8
wait 40
press A 8
wait 60
shot bi_list
press B 8
wait 60
shot bi_back
press A 8
wait 60
shot bi_list2
press B 8
wait 60
press Up 8
wait 40
press A 8
wait 60
shot bi_fight
